WEBVTT

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:07.940
Guide

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:35.090
Mitsunari.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.010
Ieyasu...

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:44.140
Mitsunari, it cannot be
helped that you despise me.

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:46.560
For what I have done
to you is of that magnitude.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:47.940
Shut up!

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:50.360
You...

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:53.780
Lord Hideyoshi found you worthy.

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:55.700
As did Lord Hanbei.

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.120
And you betrayed them!

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:01.290
For that crime, you deserve a thousand deaths!

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:05.920
I will not apologize.

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:09.250
My answer...

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.920
...will be in the future that I build!

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:14.670
Ieyasu, you bastard...

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:19.350
How much more must you mock
me before you are satisfied?!

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.430
Come, Mitsunari!

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:24.810
Ieyasu, I will kill you!

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:27.730
Ieyasu!

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:29.940
Mitsunari!

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:41.280
So, it has begun, Lord Masamune.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.910
Yeah, this thing...

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:46.540
...isn't going to end
until one of them is killed.

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:03.560
Lord Tokugawa... Lord Ishida...

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:16.110
Hang your head before Lord Hideyoshi!

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:18.150
Crave his forgiveness and beg for it!

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:20.450
And then, be beheaded!

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:22.910
I have no intention of doing so!

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:42.180
<i>This is the sort of man you have always been.</i>

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:45.510
Good work on the patrols.

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:47.520
The protection you provide

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.690
allows Lord Hideyoshi to
rest with his mind at ease.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:51.940
We depend on you men.

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:53.770
Y-Yes, Sir!

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:03.870
Ieyasu, how can you have no qualms
about saying such insincere things?!

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:06.080
You wound me to call them insincere.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.210
But you lied.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.750
Mitsunari, do not be like that.

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:15.340
Why not try offering words of
appreciation once in a while yourself?

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:19.130
Even if it is insincere?

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:28.140
I cannot find pleasure in such false words.

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:31.600
You are incredible.

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:34.480
You always look truth straight in the face.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.360
What are you saying?

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:39.820
Mitsunari, I like that gaze of yours.

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:45.160
Thanks to your straight gaze,
I can live honestly in front of you.

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:06.260
No matter how strong an army you raise...

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:08.970
No matter what pretty
excuses you shamelessly spout...

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:11.480
I have seen with these eyes...

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:14.940
...your crimes, Ieyasu!

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.570
Mitsunari.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:27.030
Ieyasu, answer me!

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:29.790
Why?! Why did you betray Lord Hideyoshi?!

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:32.910
Why did you take Lord Hideyoshi's life?!

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.170
Mitsunari...

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.380
You must have known it, too.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:44.550
That if we had continued,

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:47.220
the fighting would have
never stopped, not for all eternity.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:48.350
We cannot allow this world

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:51.390
to keep climbing the
stairs of conflict any longer!

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:52.520
Shut up!

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:54.850
That is <i>your</i> delusion.

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:57.060
You only desired this country.

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:59.610
Purely for your own greed!

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:02.690
You did nothing more than usurp
the country from Lord Hideyoshi!

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:04.200
You are a dirty little thief!

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:06.740
You dressed up your own
ambition by calling it your dream

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:09.620
and desecrated Lord Hideyoshi's rule!

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:12.660
If you say that that is
my crime, I will accept it.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.750
But I realized that what this country needs

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:17.330
is not strength, but the bonds we share!

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:18.630
That is also a lie!

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:21.500
What you realized was
that the country you desired

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:24.920
was an ugly, self-righteous ambition!

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:29.930
<i>That</i> is why you have gone on
and on about the bonds we share

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:32.770
to cover up that greed in your heart with lies!

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:33.850
Admit it!

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:36.890
That there is no truth
to the bonds you speak of!

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:39.770
I will not admit it.

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:42.480
You must have felt it, too.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:44.990
The true bond that you and I share.

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.700
Stop it!

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:51.120
Bonds... Bonds... Bonds!

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:53.910
Bonds... Bonds... Bonds... Bonds...

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:56.160
Bonds! Bonds! Bonds! Bonds!

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:57.790
Bonds!

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:00.790
Bonds...

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:07.300
I will not accept it.

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.680
By no means will I permit it!

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:13.430
I will be damned if I allow such a lie to stand!

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:18.940
Mitsunari...

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:33.490
I imagine you feel satisfied with that.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:47.010
But for me, you stole away the
bond I cherished most.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:50.470
How am I supposed to live?!

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:53.050
What should I have done?!

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:58.600
Was there no path where you
could have moved forward with me?

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.140
Do not say it...

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:01.520
Do not say it!

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:03.560
Do not put any more into words!

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:06.570
On one hand, you offer
me to share a bond with you,

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:09.780
while on the other, you steal
away my bond with Lord Hideyoshi!

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:13.120
What am I to make of it?!

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:16.540
This arrogant heart of yours so full of deceit?!

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:27.000
Answer me, Ieyasu!
Where does this contradiction lead?!

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:30.380
No matter what anyone says,
I will never abandon my bonds!

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:34.800
Just watch! I will build the future of
this country with gentle bonds!

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:40.230
I will not yield. Not to <i>you</i>.

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:45.810
To the very moment of
my death, I will not forgive you!

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:48.940
So, it seems... I cannot make you understand.

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:53.070
Wings the color of death...

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:55.280
...lay his bonds bare!

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:57.280
Be the bridge to the future,

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:59.500
my fists!

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:09.090
Lord Masamune,

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:11.010
this next blow will likely be...

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:12.590
Yeah, the last.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:15.510
But I never wanted an ending like this.

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:20.390
It is sad... Such a fight...

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:29.690
Vanish, Ieyasu!

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:32.280
Tokugawa Ieyasu!

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:34.070
This is goodbye, Mitsunari!

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:36.950
Ishida Mitsunari!

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:12.130
R-Retreat!

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:14.670
Withdraw! Withdraw!

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:16.840
<i>Having embroiled the whole of
the land of the rising sun,</i>

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:19.840
<i>this battle at Sekigahara
that divided the country in two</i>

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:22.970
<i>quietly drew to a close.</i>

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:28.810
<i>But there was no victor to be found.</i>

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:02.100
Maeda, do you not need
to return to your own land?

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:05.140
I'm a carefree vagabond, remember?

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:08.520
As the wind blows, where my whimsy takes me.

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:09.770
I see.

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:13.400
Magoichi, you guys helped out a lot.

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.820
You have my thanks.

00:11:15.780 --> 00:11:17.990
There is no need for thanks.

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:20.660
This was the contract between you and us.

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:22.040
Contract?

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:24.910
Oh! Right! I vaguely recall
something like that...

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:27.170
Nah, I totally thought...

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:29.540
Laughing about it will not get you out of this.

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:31.710
I would find this hard to believe, but...

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.880
Are you saying that
you cannot pay the contract?

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:35.800
No, no, no, no, no, no...

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:37.470
I so can't pay it...

00:11:37.470 --> 00:11:39.140
If you cannot pay it,

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:41.100
you will pay it with that body of yours.

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:41.760
What?

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:45.600
You will work the rest of your life
as a member of the Saika Folk.

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:48.150
Repair work, laundry, housework, cleaning...

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:49.730
Plus sweeping the yard and cooking the rice...

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:51.650
Anything but that!

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:54.150
Oh, there's a wind blowing from that way!

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:57.360
It's bound to be a wind
heralding a new romance!

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.000
See you around, Magoichi!

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:08.790
Let's go, Yumekichi.

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:43.950
I... am alive?

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:04.550
Mitsunari...

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:18.690
<i>In this fleeting moment of peace,</i>

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:21.990
<i>those who fought at Sekigahara</i>

00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:26.120
<i>had once again begun to live their lives...</i>

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:33.210
<b>miageyou ima ano Polaris wo</b>

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:33.210
<b>Look up to that Polaris now</b>

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:30.250
Xavi Land is finally set to open, Muneshige!

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:34.170
Th-This is...?!

00:13:34.170 --> 00:13:37.300
Behold! The dancer is Revolution!

00:13:37.300 --> 00:13:39.760
<i>Whoa, it's all so garish.</i>

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:43.180
<b>kono shinzou wa kokoro wo motazu</b>

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:43.180
<b>My heart doesn' </b>t contain a spirit

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:41.220
<i>I'm going to steer clear of this.</i>

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:43.930
Muneshige, starting today, you are Jumbo Xavi.

00:13:43.180 --> 00:13:47.640
<b>nemurenai toki wo kizamu dake da yo</b>

00:13:43.180 --> 00:13:47.640
<b>It merely marks the passage of sleepless hours</b>

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:45.430
What?!

00:13:45.430 --> 00:13:46.680
My bad!

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:49.560
You guys didn't have the key!

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:51.440
<b>ryoute de tsuchi wo kakiatsumeta</b>

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:51.440
<b>Scraping up bare earth with my two hands</b>

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:51.100
Humbly, I made a mistake!

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:54.190
Please! Let me down from here!

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:56.690
<b>ano hito no kotoba made ume ya shinai zenshin koso</b>

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:56.690
<b>won' </b>t fill the hole left by that person' s words

00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:58.150
Why?! Why does it end up this way?!

00:13:56.690 --> 00:14:01.490
<b>jouzu ni karada wo mushibande iku</b>

00:13:56.690 --> 00:14:01.490
<b>which are eating up my body</b>

00:13:58.150 --> 00:13:59.360
How do you like that?!

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:02.280
We, the illustrious Hojo family, will be restored as well!

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:05.700
I have finally caught up with you!

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:09.750
<b>hora goran yo ano Polaris wo</b>

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:09.750
<b>Just look at that Polaris</b>

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:09.700
No!

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:14.000
<b>uranometoria wo hirogetara</b>

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:14.000
<b>When you open the pages of the Uranometria</b>

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:14.040
You will deliver this letter for me?

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:22.130
<b>yogoreta tenohira ga kiten da to oshiete kureru</b>

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:22.130
<b>It' </b>ll tell you your dirty hands are the reference point

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:14.960
Yes, Sir.

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:17.590
My beautiful blade.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:20.260
Lord Kenshin...

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:24.010
<i>Lord Kenshin!</i>

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:27.300
<b>sagasu sagase yo kono samuzora ni</b>

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:27.300
<b>Searching, searching the cold night sky</b>

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:26.090
Here we go, you sons-of-bitches!

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:28.890
Yeah, Boss!

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:31.770
<b>anata no murui na kagayaki de</b>

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:31.770
<b>for your exceptional brightness</b>

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:45.110
<b>wazuka ni zahyou wo ushinawazu ni koko ni iru no ka</b>

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:45.110
<b>I would have lost the coordinates without you</b>

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:52.000
My lord, I will be asking for
the loan of your troops once more.

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:55.460
Commander, we're all set to go to war.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:58.670
Very well then.

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:04.220
Kojuro, I'm not turning to
look behind me ever again.

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:06.010
I'm counting on you to have my back.

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:06.890
Yes, Sir!

00:15:06.890 --> 00:15:10.810
You just keep moving with
your gaze fixed upon the heavens!

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:12.180
Here we go!

00:15:12.770 --> 00:15:15.440
It's the revival of the
fight to rule the country!

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:56.140
How do you like my lineup, Sanada Yukimura?!

00:15:57.980 --> 00:16:00.690
We are no less well-prepared!

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:04.860
With this great battle about to begin,

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:09.570
we are all enveloped in
the greatest sense of exaltation!

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:11.450
So good!

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:14.950
Looks like the second stage
is gonna be a lot of fun!

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:16.620
Here goes, Sanada!

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:18.790
Lord Masamune!

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:31.050
Sanada, you have signaled the start of war.

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:33.680
I will lead the vanguard!

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:37.180
Then I will serve as the tactician.

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:40.060
Make sure you put me to good use!

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:42.440
Going on a rampage is right up my alley!

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:47.820
We've thrown in our lot with
quite the idiosyncratic bunch here.

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:51.570
Yes, very much the wild and eccentric lot.

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:56.040
All have come together for this
battle to face what is in their hearts.

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:58.250
To look straight forward!

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:02.040
<i>That</i> is the spirit that our
Western Forces rallies under.

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:04.630
m -4 -4 l 1284 -4 1284 724 -4 724

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:04.630
Sanada's Western Forces

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:08.420
Look at how strong and
dependable you've become.

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:12.260
You are the same as ever, One-Eyed Dragon.

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:14.140
You truly are interesting.

00:17:14.140 --> 00:17:17.430
When it comes to parties,
the more interesting, the better.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:21.140
It is true. With Sanada and
Ishida and even Chosokabe...

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:23.690
We have nothing to complain about
with regard to our opponents.

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:24.650
Yeah.

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:25.900
m -4 -4 l 1284 -4 1284 724 -4 724

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:25.900
Date's Eastern Forces

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:29.990
Whenever I feel lost,
I just have to come here...

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:33.410
Just look to that tree as a guide,
root myself firmly in the ground,

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:36.990
and look for the path that makes sense to me.

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:40.540
One-Eyed Dragon, that is...!

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:42.710
Goodness!

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:53.260
Greetings, Sanada Yukimura, Tiger of the West!

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:56.600
Date Masamune, Dragon of the East.

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:58.100
Hearing that the victor of this battle

00:17:58.100 --> 00:18:00.020
will come to rule the land of the rising sun,

00:18:00.020 --> 00:18:02.940
we could not remain silent on the matter.

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:06.770
The Tiger of Kai and I,
too, intend to prevail in this battle

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:10.440
and then fight the battle to
determine the ruler at Kawanakajima.

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:12.610
To that end, we have formed an alliance.

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:13.820
Kawanakajima Forces

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:17.910
Time to run riot, War God!

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:18.990
Yes.

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:21.120
Lord Kenshin...

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:22.410
Here we go!

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:24.500
All units, advance!

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:27.210
m -4 -4 l 1284 -4 1284 724 -4 724

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:27.210
SECOND BATTLE OF

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:27.210
SEKIGAHARA

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:27.210
BEGINS

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:27.210
SECOND BATTLE OF

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:27.210
SEKIGAHARA

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:27.210
BEGINS

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:30.550
I swear, just how brash can that lord be?

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:31.720
What do we do, Commander?

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:34.220
You blithering idiot!

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:40.720
Even if it be from my lord,
as the commander of this army,

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:43.980
my only response to a challenge
made in earnest is to accept it!

00:18:43.980 --> 00:18:45.770
Ow, that hurt...

00:18:45.770 --> 00:18:47.150
Sanada,

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:50.230
upon this field, you are the supreme
commander of the Western Forces.

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:53.950
Swiftly fulfill your promise
to set my spirit ablaze!

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:55.950
Of course!

00:18:55.950 --> 00:18:57.820
Here we go, men!

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:02.700
Join me, Sanada Yukimura,
Western Forces Supreme Commander,

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:06.540
to set the fire within you
burning as high as it may go!

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:12.170
Lord Shingen and the War God,
and the Western Forces led by Sanada.

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:13.670
Formidable opponents.

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:18.010
But this will make it all
the more crazy the Date way.

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:25.560
Enjoy this. Ieyasu. Kojuro.

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:31.980
Eastern Forces, Number One,
Date Masamune! Pressing on!

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:44.830
Let's endless party!
